    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "mOkkb",
      "x": 21923,
      "y": 1341,
      "name": "Graph / Node Panel",
      "context": "Right-hand panel for a graph selection. It is a list of node boxes, not a single-node detail sheet: the selected node first, then every node directly linked to it. Each box carries a kind icon, the file name on one line, a relation chip naming the selected node it is linked to, and the file's description clamped to two lines. The chip carries the linked node's name only - not the property that made the link, which repeats what the icon already says. Manuscripts have no description property, so those boxes drop the line. The selected node is marked only by a 2px achromatic rule on the left - no center label, no kind label, no alias chips, no counts. The box itself is the button that opens the file.",
      "reusable": true,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 800,
      "fill": "$color-surface-navigation",
      "stroke": "$color-border-default",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "left": 1
      },
